-- Melvore Worlds & Occasions v1.2.0 -- idempotent patch for the u205121999_mel schema (MariaDB 10.6+ / 11.x)
-- Safe to re-run: every write is an UPSERT keyed on slug / asset_key. Back up first.
START TRANSACTION;

-- 1) Existing worlds: link each to its SVG kit + motion preset (merged into theme_config, nothing else is overwritten)
